Source: ttf-mscorefonts-bundled
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Brooke Hedrick <brooke.t.hedrick@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ttf-mscorefonts-bundled
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: msttcorefonts,
          ttf-mscorefonts-installer (= 3.8.1)
Conflicts: msttcorefonts,
           ttf-mscorefonts-installer
Replaces: msttcorefonts,
          ttf-mscorefonts-installer
Description: Microsoft TrueType core fonts (bundled, no download)
 Drop-in replacement for ttf-mscorefonts-installer that ships the
 Microsoft TrueType Core Fonts for the Web inside the package instead of
 downloading them from SourceForge at install time:
 .
   Andale Mono
   Arial Black
   Arial (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Comic Sans MS (Bold)
   Courier New (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Georgia (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Impact
   Times New Roman (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Trebuchet (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Verdana (Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)
   Webdings
 .
 No network access, debconf prompt or cabextract is needed.
